          "text": "Introducing Ballroom in Focus, the largest digital archive of Ballroom history, curated in collaboration with  @destinationtomorrow452, Ballroom Throwbacks and @googleartsculture. The project pays tribute to the cultural power of the Black and Latino LGBTQ+ communities that made Ballroom an expression of freedom and belonging. \nTap the link in our bio to explore more than 25 stories and nearly 1,500 never-before-seen images.",
